OtsarDB License Information
===========================

OtsarDB Is Unlicensed (Public Domain)
-------------------------------------

OtsarDB is a SQLite-derived database engine. OtsarDB's original code and
documentation is released under the Unlicense: free and unencumbered
software dedicated to the public domain.

The author disclaims copyright to this source code. In place of a legal
notice, here is a blessing:

  May you do good and not evil.
  May you find forgiveness for yourself and forgive others.
  May you share freely, never taking more than you give.

OtsarDB incorporates SQLite, which has been dedicated to the public
domain by its authors (https://sqlite.org/copyright.html). SQLite-derived
portions remain in the public domain.

Third-party components incorporated in OtsarDB retain their own licenses
(miniocpp, LZ4 and the transitive vcpkg dependencies); see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

